   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "Tubulin-folding protein; involved in the early step of the tubulin folding pathway"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "Supercomplex made of cofactors A to E. Cofactors A and D function by capturing and stabilizing tubulin in a quasi-native conformation. Cofactor E binds to the cofactor D-tubulin complex; interaction with cofactor C then causes the release of tubulin polypeptides that are committed to the native state"
    }
